ision and digital expertise. My business, and ciders, are definitely better for it!&quot;</span></p><div id="image05" class="image-component instance-5"><span class="frame"><img src="assets/images/image05.jpg?v=a283d1f7" alt="Founder | Caio Laborda-Davies" oncontextmenu="return false;" ondragstart="return false;" /></span></div><p id="text39" class="text-component instance-39"><span class="p">Lee Barresi<br /> Founder of <strong>Cider Incider</strong><br /> The UK&#39;s largest craft cider retailer</span></p></div><div><div id="gallery06" class="gallery-component instance-6 style-1" data-visibility="desktop"><div class="inner"><ul><li><span class="thumbnail n01"><span class="frame deferred"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHg9IjAiIHk9IjAiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxMTI3IDYwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjExMjciIGhlaWdodD0iNjAwIiBwcmVzZXJ2ZUFzcGVjdFJhdGlvPSJub25lIj48cmVjdCBmaWxsPSIjM2YzNzMwIiB3aWR0aD0iMTAwJSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxMDAlIi8%2BPC9zdmc%2B" data-src="assets/images/gallery06/79856e80.jpg?v=a283d1f7" alt="Untitled" title="Untitled" oncontextmenu="return false;" ondragstart="return false;" onauxclick="return false;" /></span></span></li><li><span class="thumbnail n02"><span class="frame deferred"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHg9IjAiIHk9IjAiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxMjA2IDYwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjEyMDYiIGhlaWdodD0iNjAwIiBwcmVzZXJ2ZUFzcGVjdFJhdGlvPSJub25lIj48cmVjdCBmaWxsPSIjZTJlY2Y5IiB3aWR0aD0iMTAwJSIgaGVpZ2h0PSIxMDAlIi8%2BPC9zdmc%2B" data-src="assets/images/gallery06/754ac3e1.jpg?v=a283d1f7" alt="Untitled" title="Untitled" oncontextmenu="return false;" ondragstart="return false;" onauxclick="return false;" /></span></span></li><li><span class="thumbnail n03"><span class="frame deferred"><img src="data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHg9IjAiIHk9IjAiIHZpZXdCb3g9IjAgMCAxMDcwIDYwMCIgd2lkdGg9IjEwNzAiIGhlaWdodD0iNjAwIiBwcmVzZXJ2ZUFzcGVjdFJhdGlvPSJub25lIj48cmVj